flowchart LR
    Request[User turn] --> Context[Build trusted context]
    Context --> Kind{Input type}

    Kind -->|free text| Provider[Configured semantic provider]
    Provider --> Plan[Validate one V2 domain + goal plan]
    Plan --> Policy{SemanticPlanPolicy}
    Policy -->|validated goal| Transition[TransitionController + goal conformance + exact tool]
    Transition --> Registry[ToolRegistry]
    Registry --> Trusted[Capability handler + trusted dependency]
    Trusted -->|other closed result| Present[Closed response + persistence]
    Trusted -->|business question| Facts[BusinessInformationResolver]
    Facts -->|matched fact or fail-closed answer| Present

    Kind -->|typed action| Action[StructuredActionHandler]
    Action --> Registry

    Policy -->|valid conversation.respond| Present
    Policy -->|unsafe conversation.respond| Recovery[Deterministic fallback, one re-plan, or safe clarification]
    Recovery -->|typed fallback plan| Transition
    Recovery -->|one re-plan| Provider
    Recovery -->|clarification| Present

    classDef request fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0f172a
    classDef semantic fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#0f172a
    classDef deterministic fill:#ccfbf1,stroke:#0f766e,color:#0f172a
    classDef trusted fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#0f172a
    class Request,Context,Kind,Action request
    class Provider,Plan,Recovery semantic
    class Policy,Transition,Registry,Facts,Present deterministic
    class Trusted trusted
